<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Brightly doth His Spirit shine</l><l>Into this poor heart of mine;</l><l>While He leads I cannot fall,</l><l>Loving Jesus, that is all.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Singing if my way be clear,</l><l>Praying if the path be drear;</l><l>If in danger, for Him call,</l><l>Loving Jesus, that is all.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Loving Him while life shall last,</l><l>Loving Him till earth is past,</l><l>Till His gracious advent call,</l><l>Loving Jesus, that is all.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
